SUMMARY:Teen Pancake Breakfast
DESCRIPTION:Our Teen Programs are hosting our annual Pancake Breakfast\, coming up in just a few weeks! The breakfast will be on Saturday July 26th at BJ’s Brewhouse located at 411 S. College Mall Road. The event will be from 8:00-10:00 am. And the best part?? It’s only $5 per ticket!! And that $5 goes towards supporting our teens! \nOur Pancake Breakfast is way more than just a simple breakfast–this innovative program teaches Club Teens how to take responsibility for THEIR teen program by raising money. It also teaches them sales\, customer service\, confidence and teamwork!\nTickets are available at our Lincoln Street\, Ellettsville\, & Ferguson Crestmont Clubs for only $5
URL:https://bgcbloomington.org/event/teen-pancake-breakfast-2/
LOCATION:BJ’s Restaurant & Brewhouse
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://bgcbloomington.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pancake-Breakfast-Flyer-4-x-4-in.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Boys & Girls Clubs of Bloomington":MAILTO:info@bgcbloomington.org
END:VEVENT
